# Tests of the `interrupts` module; generated from tools/interrupts.dsl by tools/build.py. They run under
# `refined test`, where machine and system targets work in the JIT's own process.

signalTest is test
signalTest purpose "No interrupt has come in a test, so interrupted is false and a wait with a passed deadline times out; the handler leaves every console event but CTRL+C to the system"
signalTest verifies signalCall runsSignal
signalTest typeParameter none
signalTest input none
signalTest output none
signalTest outputOwnedBy none
signalTest raises none
signalTest effect use machine.memory
signalTest effect use system.calls
signalTest uses memoryAccess
signalTest uses systemCalls
signalTest memoryHeap false
signalTest async false
signalTest maxRecursion none
signalTest label begin loopKind none
signalTest label begin within none
signalTest label breakEvent loopKind none
signalTest label breakEvent within none
signalTest label done loopKind none
signalTest label done within none
signalTest let shapeAt Int64 61440 immutable
signalTest let argsOffset Int64 61952 immutable
signalTest let resultsOffset Int64 62016 immutable
signalTest let payloadOffset Int64 62080 immutable
signalTest let forty Int64 40 immutable
signalTest let one Int64 1 immutable
signalTest let twoThirtyTwo Int64 232 immutable
signalTest let zero Int64 0 immutable
signalTest let twentyFour Int64 24 immutable
signalTest let two Int64 2 immutable
signalTest let ctrlBreak Int32 1 immutable
signalTest at begin do findShape
signalTest at begin do findArgs
signalTest at begin do findResults
signalTest at begin do findPayload
signalTest at begin do findCounts
signalTest at begin do storeCount
signalTest at begin do findStarts
signalTest at begin do storeStart
signalTest at begin do findParams
signalTest at begin do storeParams
signalTest at begin do readIt
signalTest at begin do readFlag
signalTest at begin do doAssertEqualInt64
signalTest at begin do storeDeadline
signalTest at begin do waitIt
signalTest at begin do widenWait
signalTest at begin do doAssertEqualInt642
signalTest at begin do onLinux
signalTest at begin branch if linux goto done else goto breakEvent
signalTest at breakEvent do leaveIt
signalTest at breakEvent do widenLeft
signalTest at breakEvent do doAssertEqualInt643
signalTest at breakEvent goto done
signalTest at done return ok none

